Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:22.68,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}おだやかさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:25.20,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}でもせっつく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.20,0:01:28.97,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}愛は人を急かす
